 "notes": "Builder iu-1. CLINC150: Larson et al., 'An Evaluation Dataset for Intent Classification and Out-of-Scope Prediction', EMNLP-IJCNLP 2019; data by Clinc, Inc., https://github.com/clinc/oos-eval, CC BY 3.0. Banking77: Casanueva et al., 'Efficient Intent Detection with Dual Sentence Encoders', NLP4ConvAI 2020; data by PolyAI, https://github.com/PolyAI-LDN/task-specific-datasets, CC BY 4.0. Changes: utterances wrapped in question templates, intent names shown with underscores as spaces (lower case), CLINC out-of-scope class dropped, duplicates and conflicting labels removed, subsampled. CLINC150 uses plus/train + plus/validation (oos dropped); Banking77 uses banking_data/train.csv only (the official test.csv is not used). The HF banking77.py loading script is stored as text and never executed."
